      <p>Beware that the subnet labels configured in FlowCollectorSlice are not limited to the flows of the related namespace: any flow in the whole cluster can be labeled using this configuration. However, subnet labels defined in the cluster-scoped FlowCollector take precedence in case of conflicting rules.</p>
